.TH GIT-REVIEW 1
.SH NAME
git-review \- open Git Viewer for the current working tree
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B git review
.RI [ BASE ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Open or focus the review window for the working tree containing the current
directory. The review shows the merge base, HEAD, and the working tree.
.PP
With
.IR BASE ,
compare against that Git ref. The default tries
.BR origin/HEAD ,
.BR main ,
then
.BR master .
